<p>Many different <b>file types</b> are generated by the Dragon Age Toolset or are generated by third party applications for use with either the toolset or the game. These file types can be categorised as:
</p>
<ul><li> BioWare File Types, or</li>
<li> Third Party File Types</li></ul>
<p>Files can be <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Art%20Resources" title="Art Resources">Art Resources</a>, exported <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Designer%20Resources" title="Designer Resources">Designer Resources</a> or external resources.
</p>
